{
  "os": "arista_eos",
  "command": "show ip bgp",
  "schema": {
    "name": "ShowIpBgpResult",
    "fields": {
      "vrfs": {
        "type": {
          "type": "dict",
          "key": "str",
          "value": {
            "name": "VrfEntry",
            "fields": {
              "router_id": {
                "type": "str",
                "required": true
              },
              "local_as": {
                "type": "int",
                "required": true
              },
              "local_as_asdot": {
                "type": "str",
                "required": false
              },
              "routes": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "dict",
                  "key": "str",
                  "value": {
                    "name": "RouteEntry",
                    "fields": {
                      "paths": {
                        "type": {
                          "type": "list",
                          "items": {
                            "name": "PathEntry",
                            "fields": {
                              "status_codes": {
                                "type": "str",
                                "required": true
                              },
                              "next_hop": {
                                "type": "str",
                                "required": false
                              },
                              "metric": {
                                "type": "int",
                                "required": false
                              },
                              "local_pref": {
                                "type": "int",
                                "required": false
                              },
                              "weight": {
                                "type": "int",
                                "required": false
                              },
                              "as_path": {
                                "type": "str",
                                "required": false
                              },
                              "origin": {
                                "type": "str",
                                "required": true
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "required": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "required": true
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "Multi-VRF BGP table with locally originated and eBGP-learned routes",
      "input": "BGP routing table information for VRF default\nRouter identifier 10.103.1.1, local AS number 103\nRoute status codes: s - suppressed, * - valid, > - active, # - not installed, E - ECMP head, e - ECMP\n                    S - Stale, c - Contributing to ECMP, b - backup\nOrigin codes: i - IGP, e - EGP, ? - incomplete\nAS Path Attributes: Or-ID - Originator ID, C-LST - Cluster List, LL Nexthop - Link Local Nexthop\n\n       Network             Next Hop         Metric  LocPref Weight Path\n * >   10.103.1.0/24       -                1       0       -       i\n * >   10.103.2.0/24       -                1       0       -       i\n * >   10.103.3.0/24       -                1       0       -       i\n * >   10.103.4.0/24       -                1       0       -       i\n * #   10.104.1.0/24       10.10.10.20      0       100     0       104 i\n * #   10.104.2.0/24       10.10.10.20      0       100     0       104 i\n * #   10.104.3.0/24       10.10.10.20      0       100     0       104 i\n * #   10.104.4.0/24       10.10.10.20      0       100     0       104 i\nBGP routing table information for VRF INTERNET\nRouter identifier 172.26.159.40, local AS number 62222.4003\nRoute status codes: s - suppressed, * - valid, > - active, # - not installed, E - ECMP head, e - ECMP\n                    S - Stale, c - Contributing to ECMP, b - backup, L - labeled-unicast\nOrigin codes: i - IGP, e - EGP, ? - incomplete\nAS Path Attributes: Or-ID - Originator ID, C-LST - Cluster List, LL Nexthop - Link Local Nexthop\n\n         Network                Next Hop            Metric  LocPref Weight  Path\n * >     10.9.41.96/29          172.26.159.6          0       5000    0       62222.4002 ?\n",
      "expected": {
